 Strategy, Mission & History Diversity, Equity, Inclusion & Belonging Community Resources Clinics & Centers Wolfgram Memorial Library Observatory Taylor Arboretum Faculty Directory Offices & Departments Maps & Directions Work at Widener President's Leadership Team Apply Visit Utility Menu WU Links myWidener mySuccess Canvas Outlook Email Office365 Zoom Self Service Wolfgram Library Campus Store Resources For You High School Students New First-Year & Transfer Students Current Students Parents & Families Faculty & Staff Alumni Community & Partners News Events Athletics ♥ Give Meet the Career Design & Development Team Academics Academic Resources for Success Academic & Career Support Career Design & Development Meet the Career Design & Development Team Julie Abrams Director of Professional Development, Career Design & Development jabrams@widener.edu 610-499-1271 Lauren Barlow Career Consultant ljdepaul@widener.edu (610) 499-4431 Michelle Keller Advancement Coordinator makeller@widener.edu (610) 499-1198 Jeff C. Kriebel Assistant Director jckriebel@widener.edu (610) 499-4178 Janet R. Long Associate Vice President, Career Design & Development jrlong@widener.edu (610) 499-4045 Nikki Queen Program Manager nmqueen@widener.edu 610-499-4177 Katrina Robinson Assistant Director krrobinson2@widener.edu (610) 499-4509 One University Place Chester, PA 19013 1-888-WIDENER Facebook Widener Instagram LinkedIn Widener TikTok Twitter Youtube Interactive Campus Map Apply to Widener Directions, Parking & Transportation Explore All Programs Work at Widener © 2026 Widener University Widener University uses IP2Location.io IP geolocation web service. Campus Safety Report It Privacy Consumer Information"
